21（落败方退出 3、保持 PREPARED）。取消：P4-G07、L01、L02、L22、C68–C71（Windows CTRL_BREAK；恢复结果锁定为 CANCELLED）；P4-L03、L04（POSIX SIGINT）本机跳过，NOT_RUN。补丁完整性：P4-G16–G19、C63。每一类、每一门都至少有一个 measured / PASS 的失败路径断言方法。旧自测 tests/test_dispatch.py 的原有映射仍有效（收尾取证 stdout 与 bl-01t1 逐字节相同）。4 个测试文件的字节与最终取证相同；公共夹具 tests/legacy_harness.py 由 3d133d5f… 改为 c4e87137…（清理前归属核对），收尾取证的结果绑定新字节","baseline_ref":{"closure":{"baseline_consistent":true,"captures":[{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-dispatch-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37048,"original_sha256":"a5d1c5ecd4fa80d1b6a0051e8ab950ca0fb099b27688bb02912705b596105659","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-dispatch-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha256":"7a3d33148a117766d50fc9ab4e27e8ea3c1b0d41816f2d09594dd799541ca114"}},{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-protocols-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37048,"original_sha256":"c0df97cd6dcd90a4467810de7ae8bdd7825827974fb2e533ee0cbaf5d12f94aa","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-protocols-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha256":"9bb0a5d272fad21fb7e565c084f03c86846fafe7cec51e51a2ede8121854aca3"}},{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-baseline-tool-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37063,"original_sha256":"5b05e0a3efa2bcdb3e477dfd2a26fade461940986c302cf8943a3f11d5846c18","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-baseline-tool-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha256":"de6f1c35b459cec59df593b4b7a9cdc5d27c54a8bd06b4579b5579fc5786214d"}},{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-legacy-gates-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37059,"original_sha256":"c6ea48d5a0c1820f58dcd031ee499dc98f325542a120fa82ff05c43534b4db86","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-legacy-gates-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha25