 --check 与 --check-stub-regen）；baseline_tool（test_baseline_tool.py）。附录 B 参考代码的沙箱验证仍在 reference_code 栏，证据只在 evidence/reference-appendix-b-windows/，最终取证与收尾取证都没有重跑，也没有并入。各栏结论分条陈述：旧自测的 PASS 不代替新测试，新测试不代替旧自测，参考自测的 FAIL（test_static_resolution）不因项目测试通过而改判。evidence/closure/INDEX.md 第 2 节写明 10 次取证都是项目验证、附录 B 参考代码验证是另一栏（第 8 节另写明该目录不判定验收）；legacy-inventory.md 第 0.5、12.1 节的用词已按 M-08 改为“01 新代码测试（公共协议、fixtures、取证工具）”","applicability_by_platform":{"linux":{"applicability":"not_applicable","applicability_reason":"分栏记录是报告与证据目录的结构规则，不随平台变化；标 not_applicable 不表示 Linux 上有任何测试运行或通过，Linux 上各栏的测试结果仍是 NOT_RUN"},"macos":{"applicability":"not_applicable","applicability_reason":"同 linux：分栏规则不分平台；macOS 上各栏的测试结果仍是 NOT_RUN"},"windows":{"applicability":"applicable"}},"baseline_ref":{"closure":{"baseline_consistent":true,"captures":[{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-dispatch-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37048,"original_sha256":"a5d1c5ecd4fa80d1b6a0051e8ab950ca0fb099b27688bb02912705b596105659","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-dispatch-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha256":"7a3d33148a117766d50fc9ab4e27e8ea3c1b0d41816f2d09594dd799541ca114"}},{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-protocols-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37048,"original_sha256":"c0df97cd6dcd90a4467810de7ae8bdd7825827974fb2e533ee0cbaf5d12f94aa","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-protocols-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha256":"9bb0a5d272fad21fb7e565c084f03c86846fafe7cec51e51a2ede8121854aca3"}},{"capture_id":"bl-01closure-test-baseline-tool-20260926","capture_json":{"bytes":37063,"original_sha256":"5b05e0a3efa2bcdb3e477dfd2a26fade461940986c302cf8943a3f11d5846c18","path":"docs/themis-tally-v2/01-baseline/evidence/closure/bl-01closure-test-baseline-tool-20260926/capture.json","redacted_changed":true,"role":"取证记录（脱敏改写 <PYDIR> 1 处）","sha256":"de6f1c35b459cec59d